{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《AtomicHabits》是一款結合任務整理、習慣建立與專注計時的工具，適合想把目標拆成每日小行動的人；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-129.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>任務習慣與專注整合</h2>\n<p>用戶可把任務分成家庭、朋友與工作等分類，設定優先次序、截止日期和提醒，亦可匯入或匯出 CSV。建立習慣時，先寫下想成為的人，再設定完整目標與最低版本，記錄進度、連續日數和活動日曆；忙碌時可安排較小行動。程式另有習慣實驗室、例行組合與番茄鐘專注計時，並支援多種介面語言。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-64.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-65.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-66.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-67.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-68.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：AtomicHabits: Tasks &amp; Growth</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/atomichabits-tasks-growth/id6794384621?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T19:00:39.165172+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":284,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T18:48:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T20:38:24.085163+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T18:58:33.092300+00:00","content_hash":"41d1060859ead35114853d7cb234776da096a467f3de98e35cf8b969b2a4da44","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}